[
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 3.0,
    "text": "And I said, well, you know, that's far away from home."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 3.0,
    "end_time": 6.0,
    "text": "Any familiar face is a comfort, even if it is just my crisis."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 6.0,
    "end_time": 7.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 7.0,
    "end_time": 9.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 9.0,
    "end_time": 11.0,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 11.0,
    "end_time": 13.0,
    "text": "Anyway, um, well, that was fun."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 13.0,
    "end_time": 14.0,
    "text": "The food was great."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 14.0,
    "end_time": 15.0,
    "text": "It was catered."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 15.0,
    "end_time": 16.0,
    "text": "It was just wonderful."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 16.0,
    "end_time": 17.0,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 17.0,
    "end_time": 19.0,
    "text": "And I won't tell you everything because it's all in your letter."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 19.0,
    "end_time": 20.0,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 20.0,
    "end_time": 22.0,
    "text": "Yeah, I noticed that every time I get a letter, I said,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 22.0,
    "end_time": 24.0,
    "text": "well, we've covered all this."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 24.0,
    "end_time": 27.0,
    "text": "And, uh, but it's still good to get the letters."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 27.0,
    "end_time": 29.0,
    "text": "Yeah, you can reread them."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 29.0,
    "end_time": 30.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 30.0,
    "end_time": 32.0,
    "text": "And I have reread them, Rory."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 32.0,
    "end_time": 33.0,
    "text": "And get my pictures."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 33.0,
    "end_time": 34.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 34.0,
    "end_time": 36.0,
    "text": "Oh, you see, they can't say ours over here."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 36.0,
    "end_time": 38.0,
    "text": "And some of these hotels, a lot of the hotels,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 38.0,
    "end_time": 40.0,
    "text": "when you get in the elevator and you want to go downstairs,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 40.0,
    "end_time": 41.0,
    "text": "you have to press Robby."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 41.0,
    "end_time": 42.0,
    "text": "Robby?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 42.0,
    "end_time": 43.0,
    "text": "Robby."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 43.0,
    "end_time": 44.0,
    "text": "Robby?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 44.0,
    "end_time": 45.0,
    "text": "It's spelled R-O-B-B-Y?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 45.0,
    "end_time": 46.0,
    "text": "Yep."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 46.0,
    "end_time": 53.0,
    "text": "Well, when I called the first time to get your room number,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 53.0,
    "end_time": 57.0,
    "text": "I said, who do you want to talk to?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 57.0,
    "end_time": 58.0,
    "text": "I said, um, McGuire?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 58.0,
    "end_time": 59.0,
    "text": "He said, what's the name?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 59.0,
    "end_time": 60.0,
    "text": "I said, McGuire?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 60.0,
    "end_time": 62.0,
    "text": "And he said, Mr. Rery?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 62.0,
    "end_time": 64.0,
    "text": "I said, yep."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 64.0,
    "end_time": 65.0,
    "text": "Ratch him."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 65.0,
    "end_time": 66.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 66.0,
    "end_time": 68.0,
    "text": "Well, they have a problem with that."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 68.0,
    "end_time": 71.0,
    "text": "That's deep."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 71.0,
    "end_time": 72.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 72.0,
    "end_time": 73.0,
    "text": "Um, let's see."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 73.0,
    "end_time": 76.0,
    "text": "I'm just going to work and back and forth."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 76.0,
    "end_time": 79.0,
    "text": "I'm filling out applications for jobs and trying to get them sent in."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 79.0,
    "end_time": 80.0,
    "text": "I've got to finish them up Monday."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 80.0,
    "end_time": 81.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 81.0,
    "end_time": 84.0,
    "text": "Well, you've had an interview at Valley already?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 84.0,
    "end_time": 85.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 85.0,
    "end_time": 86.0,
    "text": "It was fine."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 86.0,
    "end_time": 88.0,
    "text": "They'll call me if they have any night classes available,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 88.0,
    "end_time": 89.0,
    "text": "but right now they don't."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 89.0,
    "end_time": 91.0,
    "text": "And they don't."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 91.0,
    "end_time": 93.0,
    "text": "They're probably not going to get any."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 93.0,
    "end_time": 94.0,
    "text": "So I just have to wait and see."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 94.0,
    "end_time": 96.0,
    "text": "Northridge, I don't know anything about either."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 96.0,
    "end_time": 97.0,
    "text": "But it's all in the letter."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 97.0,
    "end_time": 98.0,
    "text": "That's in the letter."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 98.0,
    "end_time": 99.0,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 99.0,
    "end_time": 101.0,
    "text": "I talked to Ken and Vicki yesterday."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 101.0,
    "end_time": 104.0,
    "text": "And I think Ken might have gone to Arizona today to work."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 104.0,
    "end_time": 106.0,
    "text": "He got laid off when they stopped."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 106.0,
    "end_time": 109.0,
    "text": "Well, you weren't here when they had the big sinkholes in Hollywood?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 109.0,
    "end_time": 110.0,
    "text": "No."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 110.0,
    "end_time": 111.0,
    "text": "Due to the metro rail?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 111.0,
    "end_time": 113.0,
    "text": "Well, they've had those off and on."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 113.0,
    "end_time": 114.0,
    "text": "Well, not big ones."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 114.0,
    "end_time": 117.0,
    "text": "Well, there was this one that was about, you know, five blocks long."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 117.0,
    "end_time": 118.0,
    "text": "Oh, really?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 118.0,
    "end_time": 120.0,
    "text": "Well, not five blocks, but it was, you know, a good."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 120.0,
    "end_time": 122.0,
    "text": "A good size hole."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 122.0,
    "end_time": 124.0,
    "text": "It was a close hauler at Boulevard for a long time."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 124.0,
    "end_time": 128.0,
    "text": "It was about 60 feet by 100 feet or something."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 128.0,
    "end_time": 129.0,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 129.0,
    "end_time": 130.0,
    "text": "It was big."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 130.0,
    "end_time": 132.0,
    "text": "And so they shut down metro rail because, you know,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 132.0,
    "end_time": 133.0,
    "text": "it's all because of that."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 133.0,
    "end_time": 135.0,
    "text": "They're not doing things the way they're supposed to."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 135.0,
    "end_time": 138.0,
    "text": "And consequently, the Boulevard's caving in."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 138.0,
    "end_time": 140.0,
    "text": "And Ken was working that, you know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 140.0,
    "end_time": 144.0,
    "text": "So he was laid off."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 144.0,
    "end_time": 147.0,
    "text": "And they said the other night that he thought he would go to Japan"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 147.0,
    "end_time": 150.0,
    "text": "because he could get to Japan, go to Arizona,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 150.0,
    "end_time": 154.0,
    "text": "because he could sign up and start working Monday."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 154.0,
    "end_time": 156.0,
    "text": "Only the pay is not as good as here."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 156.0,
    "end_time": 157.0,
    "text": "So he has to work overtime."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 157.0,
    "end_time": 159.0,
    "text": "And it's a 60-hour week."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 159.0,
    "end_time": 161.0,
    "text": "And therefore, he can't come home on weekends."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 162.0,
    "end_time": 164.0,
    "text": "I think he was doing the yard this morning."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 164.0,
    "end_time": 166.0,
    "text": "I said, well, maybe he's not going if he's in the yard work."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 166.0,
    "end_time": 168.0,
    "text": "And then later I saw him packing up the truck."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 168.0,
    "end_time": 170.0,
    "text": "And then I missed when he left."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 170.0,
    "end_time": 172.0,
    "text": "I didn't see, you know, Vicki say goodbye or anything."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 172.0,
    "end_time": 178.0,
    "text": "So he may be off to Arizona for God knows how long."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 178.0,
    "end_time": 181.0,
    "text": "We have new neighbors they moved in."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 181.0,
    "end_time": 182.0,
    "text": "Well, who are they?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 182.0,
    "end_time": 183.0,
    "text": "What are they?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 183.0,
    "end_time": 186.0,
    "text": "There's some kind of Mexicans with three kids."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 186.0,
    "end_time": 187.0,
    "text": "Oh, boy."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 187.0,
    "end_time": 188.0,
    "text": "And a dog."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 188.0,
    "end_time": 189.0,
    "text": "Oh, boy."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 189.0,
    "end_time": 192.0,
    "text": "But the dog seems fairly cool that he hasn't barked too much."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 192.0,
    "end_time": 193.0,
    "text": "Is he a big dog?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 193.0,
    "end_time": 194.0,
    "text": "Ah, fairly big."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 194.0,
    "end_time": 196.0,
    "text": "He looks sort of like a,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 196.0,
    "end_time": 198.0,
    "text": "thought, bub-sized but poodle-ish,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 198.0,
    "end_time": 200.0,
    "text": "but doesn't weigh as much as bub."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 200.0,
    "end_time": 201.0,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 201.0,
    "end_time": 203.0,
    "text": "And Jojo had one of his parties again last night."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 203.0,
    "end_time": 205.0,
    "text": "Boy, they're out there till all hours."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 205.0,
    "end_time": 206.0,
    "text": "Oh, they do that."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 206.0,
    "end_time": 207.0,
    "text": "I know."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 207.0,
    "end_time": 208.0,
    "text": "That's fine."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 208.0,
    "end_time": 209.0,
    "text": "I thought, I looked over, I said,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 209.0,
    "end_time": 211.0,
    "text": "gee, I wonder if he's got the new people over there already,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 211.0,
    "end_time": 212.0,
    "text": "you know?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 212.0,
    "end_time": 214.0,
    "text": "Ha, ha, ha, ha."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 214.0,
    "end_time": 217.0,
    "text": "Is, uh, Joy still doing the lawn?"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 217.0,
    "end_time": 218.0,
    "text": "Yep."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 218.0,
    "end_time": 220.0,
    "text": "I told you, I sent you some money,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 220.0,
    "end_time": 222.0,
    "text": "and then I told you it was also paying,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 222.0,
    "end_time": 224.0,
    "text": "because I think he's going on vacation."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 224.0,
    "end_time": 226.0,
    "text": "He went on vacation the second week,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 226.0,
    "end_time": 228.0,
    "text": "and I took, after the second week,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 228.0,
    "end_time": 230.0,
    "text": "after he'd done the grass two times,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 230.0,
    "end_time": 232.0,
    "text": "I went over to, you know, give him 20 bucks,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 232.0,
    "end_time": 234.0,
    "text": "because I thought, I knew he was going on vacation,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 234.0,
    "end_time": 236.0,
    "text": "and it was, Dennis was there,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 236.0,
    "end_time": 238.0,
    "text": "and I said, well, I know Joy's going on vacation,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 238.0,
    "end_time": 240.0,
    "text": "so I wanted to give him some money so he'd have it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 240.0,
    "end_time": 242.0,
    "text": "And Dennis said, he's already gone,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 242.0,
    "end_time": 244.0,
    "text": "and Vivian said, Dennis wrote the lawn today,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 244.0,
    "end_time": 247.0,
    "text": "and I said, well, he makes sure Joy gets his money."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 247.0,
    "end_time": 249.0,
    "text": "Anyway, he's been doing a good job."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 249.0,
    "end_time": 251.0,
    "text": "He forgot one day, and came over later that night,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 251.0,
    "end_time": 253.0,
    "text": "and he was just apologizing all over the place,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 253.0,
    "end_time": 255.0,
    "text": "and I said, there's no big deal, Joy."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 255.0,
    "end_time": 256.0,
    "text": "Just do it tomorrow."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 256.0,
    "end_time": 258.0,
    "text": "So I'm sorry, I'm sorry."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 258.0,
    "end_time": 259.0,
    "text": "I just feel terrible."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 259.0,
    "end_time": 260.0,
    "text": "I said, don't worry about it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 260.0,
    "end_time": 262.0,
    "text": "It's no problem."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 262.0,
    "end_time": 264.0,
    "text": "I told him yesterday you might hire him full-time,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 264.0,
    "end_time": 266.0,
    "text": "because you don't like to do the grass."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 266.0,
    "end_time": 269.0,
    "text": "Well, I might, depending on how long this money holds out."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 269.0,
    "end_time": 270.0,
    "text": "Ha, ha."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 270.0,
    "end_time": 272.0,
    "text": "Well, if we're going to have to buy a new car, dear,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 272.0,
    "end_time": 273.0,
    "text": "you know that."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 273.0,
    "end_time": 274.0,
    "text": "Yeah, I know that."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 274.0,
    "end_time": 275.0,
    "text": "My transmission's going."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 275.0,
    "end_time": 276.0,
    "text": "You're kidding."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 276.0,
    "end_time": 278.0,
    "text": "I'm not sure it is."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 279.0,
    "end_time": 281.0,
    "text": "It's having trouble in reverse."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 281.0,
    "end_time": 282.0,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 282.0,
    "end_time": 284.0,
    "text": "So I'm keeping an eye on it,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 284.0,
    "end_time": 287.0,
    "text": "but we just have to do it."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 287.0,
    "end_time": 289.0,
    "text": "That's what we'll do when you first get home."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 289.0,
    "end_time": 290.0,
    "text": "We'll buy the new car."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 290.0,
    "end_time": 292.0,
    "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 292.0,
    "end_time": 294.0,
    "text": "We may have to do that right away."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 294.0,
    "end_time": 295.0,
    "text": "We really do."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 295.0,
    "end_time": 297.0,
    "text": "We shouldn't try to get any more miles out of any of these,"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "A",
    "start_time": 297.0,
    "end_time": 298.0,
    "text": "because they're going to get stuck somewhere."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 298.0,
    "end_time": 299.0,
    "text": "Oh, no."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 299.0,
    "end_time": 300.0,
    "text": "I don't really want to."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 300.0,
    "end_time": 302.0,
    "text": "I just want to get out there in that first week"
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_000.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 302.0,
    "end_time": 304.0,
    "text": "and start doing it, you know."
  }
]
